{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:94485","published":"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-04T16:45:03.668237057Z","related":["CVE-2026-76235","CVE-2026-91147"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-76235","CVE-2026-91147"],"summary":"Moderate: cockpit security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"Cockpit enables users to administer GNU/Linux servers using a web browser. It offers network configuration, log inspection, diagnostic reports, SELinux troubleshooting, interactive command-line sessions, and more.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * cockpit: Cockpit: Denial of Service in `cockpit-ws` due to URL-root handling without a trailing slash (CVE-2026-91147)\n  * cockpit-ws: cockpit: cockpit-ws: unauthenticated remote memory leak via CockpitLang cookie in send_login_html (CVE-2026-76235)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * [cockpit] Overview page should not try to read insights-client.json anymore (JIRA:RHEL-246964)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cockpit","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/cockpit"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"310.10-1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:94485.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cockpit-bridge","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/cockpit-bridge"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"310.10-1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:94485.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cockpit-doc","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/cockpit-doc"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"310.10-1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"